content+=table(headline)+'''<h2>Explore the accepted sample</h2><p>The equity curve is sequential realized P&amp;L for the selected subset. It omits unpriced trades and open-position excursions. Percentage drawdown is unavailable without a defensible starting capital and margin model.</p><div class="controls"><label>Timeframe <select id="tf"><option>5</option><option>15</option><option>30</option></select></label><label>Mode <select id="mode"><option>ATM_BUY</option><option>ATM_SELL</option></select></label><label>Scenario <select id="scenario"><option value="gross">Gross</option><option value="base">Modeled base net</option><option value="stress">Modeled stress net</option></select></label></div><p id="stats"></p><svg id="equity" viewBox="0 0 1100 340" role="img" aria-label="Accepted-subset realized equity curve"></svg><div id="yearly"></div><h2>Trade-by-trade audit</h2><p>Open a timeframe to view spot candlesticks, both EMAs, entry/exit markers, raw premiums, individual costs, contracts and lot assumptions. Unpriced candidates stay visible. The full-mode KPI totals in those audit views stay unavailable whenever any trade is missing.</p><p><a href="audit-5.html">5-minute audit</a> · <a href="audit-15.html">15-minute audit</a> · <a href="audit-30.html">30-minute audit</a> · <a href="trades.csv">Accepted trades and per-charge costs CSV</a> · <a href="exclusions.csv">All exclusions CSV</a> · <a href="summary.csv">All metrics CSV</a> · <a href="yearly.csv">Yearly CSV</a> · <a href="monthly.csv">Monthly CSV</a> · <a href="independent-audit.json">Independent validation</a></p><h2>Rules and assumptions</h2><p>Hypothesis: spot EMA9/21 crosses capture directional persistence sufficient to offset option decay and friction. Separate SMA seeds over9/21 closes; carry state across accepted days; incomplete observed sessions and gaps&gt;7days reset state. Equality retains the last nonzero ordering; initialization is not a cross. Bars align09:15; 30m session remainder is discarded. Signal at bar close fills exact next minute open, with no future high/low fill selection. Opposite crosses always exit; reverse only within the entry window. Square-off15:00 takes precedence even when inside a30m bar. No stop or target is invented.</p><p>ATM uses the signal spot close rounded to nearest50, ties upward, frozen before entry. Bullish buyCE/bearish buyPE; bullish sellPE/bearish sellCE. One lot. Entry and exit use the same strike and WEEK family from expiryCode1. A positive-volume entry and exit and every minute of the fixed-strike path are required. No missing tail, interpolation or switch to a new ATM strike. Actual bid/ask/depth, delays and fills remain unknown.</p><h2>Data and lot provenance</h2><p>Reuses the project's saved Dhan IDX_I/13 NIFTY native1m export (quality NATIVE_5M_WINDOW_CONFIRMED), not new data from another broker. Spot spans1Nov2021–30Oct2026; 1,174 complete sessions plus58 observed rejected dates; entire missing sessions and exchange holidays are not certified. Saved options cover older Nov2021–earlyFeb2023 and Nov2025–Oct2026 intervals, with a substantial middle gap. A newer annual server import exists but is not part of this retained snapshot or this report. 3,485 NIFTY archive chunks passed stored SHA256 checks; request exchange NSE_FNO/security13/expiryCode1 confirmed. Actual expiry/security IDs are omitted by the rolling feed.</p><p>Uses references/index-option-lot-sizes.json and its six official NSE circulars:50units in the older available NIFTY sample,75 for nearest Nov/Dec2025 family,65 for Jan2026-onward nearest family. These are CONDITIONAL_NEAREST_FAMILY assignments, not recovered exact contract identities. 18mode observations in24–30Dec2025 are additionally transition-sensitive; quantities65/75 are supplied as bounds in the ledger. No constant65 is applied to all history. No INR sums across strategies or modes are presented as a portfolio.</p><h2>Friction model</h2><p>Two orders × ₹20 fixed brokerage, STT0.15% sell premium turnover, exchange0.05% both sides, SEBI0.0001% both, stamp0.003% buy, IPFT0.0005% both, GST18% on brokerage+exchange+SEBI+IPFT. These fixed conservative rates are a hypothetical scenario across all dates. They are deliberately not claimed as actual historical rates. Per-charge rounding to paise can differ from contract notes. Current rate references support the fee categories, not a historical tariff reconstruction.</p><p><a href="https://www.nseindia.com/static/products-services/equity-derivatives-securities-transaction-tax">NSE STT schedule</a> · <a href="https://www.nseindia.com/static/invest/first-time-investor-sebi-turnover-fees-stt-other-levies">NSE levies and stamp/GST</a> · <a href="https://zerodha.com/charges/">Broker fee-category reference</a> · <a href="https://dhanhq.co/docs/v2/expired-options-data/">Dhan rolling-options schema</a>. No Zerodha or Groww prices/accounts were used.</p><h2>Exclusions and selection risk</h2>'''+table(r['exclusionCounts'])+'''<h2>Assessment</h2><p>Validation required; this sample does not demonstrate a robust tradable edge. Five/15m lose in accepted gross and cost scenarios. The30m ATM-sell accepted sample has positive gross and small base net, but negative stress net. Pricing coverage only33–37%, missing middle years, unknown exact expiry IDs, no walk-forward holdout and no feasible short-option capital/margin simulation prevent live adoption. Full-calendar totals, CAGR and capital drawdown are unavailable. Do not treat the excluded observations as no-trade days or zero P&amp;L.</p><h2>Reproduction</h2><p>Java engine/CLI and native audit UI are implemented on codex/nifty-ema921-20261102. No production data writes, trading activation, orders, scheduled jobs or deployment. Source PDF rule transcription is in docs/nifty-ema921.md. Inputs are hashed in inputs.json. Independent Python replay verifies4,016 Java signal trades and131,488 resampled candles; accepted-ledger accounting and18summary totals reconcile. Focused Java/MVC tests and browser checks are recorded alongside this report.</p>'''
